        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ntau kathan nzianmei Pu bam khou,",
            "Poubaomei ram ‘tik dai;",
            "Neihlaa mei munrim gaimei mun puang the,",
            "Puangtuai dat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "Neihlaa puikai khou kariu puni,",
            "Tingkao rihmei guay lev banghmei guai;",
            "Ryanrapui ram khou kalangh bammei,",
            "Pou’ hukhou neihla pui lu suanni.",
            "",
            "2. Ai rui ringhpui tingmik nai bamsaan khou,",
            "Akhang muangh kumna zing;",
            "Aniu rui mi ram tanghpui kaan khou rui,",
            "Kandi hei ning lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Hei kumhpui namdaih tei tanghpui kan khou,",
            "Kandih hei ning lak khe;",
            "Ntau karim namh gaimei tei namh the,",
            "He ! Adih gaini cho?",
            "",
            "4. Ata kanloumeipu kaipou hukhou,",
            "Kaguangh hukhou dingni;",
            "Latzan swni kan loumei’ neihlaa khang,",
            "Hallelujah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
